    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in the crumbled tofu. Then add the curry powder, turmeric, cumin, salt, and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/curried-tofu-and-spinach-scramble/#wprm-recipe-59678-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/curried-tofu-and-spinach-scramble-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the diced tomatoes, then cook for a few minutes. Stir frequently, adding more oil if needed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/curried-tofu-and-spinach-scramble/#wprm-recipe-59678-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/curried-tofu-and-spinach-scramble-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the spinach, then cover the pan and let cook for a few more minutes or until the spinach is wilted.",
